      "changes": [
        {
          "category": "changed",
          "text": "Update the managed Grok CLI to 1.0.52 (bytes identical from x.ai/cli and the official GCS mirror). The spawn flags and the ACP initialize contract are verified on the new binary; extension methods stay lazily confirmed per attach. Known limitation: the native approval cards observed for compound shell commands under 1.0.46 despite auto/always_approve snapshots remain unverified on 1.0.52 (an authenticated session is required); no fix is claimed. The wire protocol range is unchanged. Artifacts pass hosted qualification; real model turns were not run for this release.",
          "evidence": [
            "https://github.com/RichLogic/Gian-Proxies/releases/tag/proxy-grok-v0.3.9",
            "https://github.com/RichLogic/Gian-Proxies/blob/proxy-grok-v0.3.9/packages/proxies/grok-proxy/README.md"
